  "prefLabel": "Ins 1201.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-04-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1201.02 Scope.\n\n(a) This part shall apply to all life insurance and accident and health insurance, whether group or individual, sold in connection with loans or other credit transactions, except such insurance sold in connection with:\n\n(1) A loan or other credit transaction of more than 15 years' duration;\n\n(2) A first real estate mortgage; or\n\n(3) A loan secured by a filing under the Uniform Commercial Code pursuant to RSA 477:44, IV.\n\n(b) The scope of this part shall be identical to that of RSA 408-A as stated in RSA 408-A:2.\n\nSource. #1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #2441, eff 1-1-84; amd by #3196, eff 2-5-86; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5650, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED 7-1-99\n\nNew. #7146, eff 4-1-00, EXPIRED: 4-1-08\n\nNew. #9611, eff 1-4-10; ss by #12474, eff 2-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1200.html"
